<translate>
==== UnhappyChange ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Indicates how much unhappy the use of the item will remove. If the number is negative, unhappy will decrease, if it is positive, it will increase.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
UnhappyChange = -10,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

